Cell["\<\
The code works as follows:

\t1) Evaluate the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Basic module\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
section.
\t2) The \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Examples\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] section \
serves as a tutorial to use the code and generates some of the plots in \
[2502.XXXXXX]. Evaluating the full section may take around 15 min, some \
examples take only a few seconds while others    \ttake several minutes.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.945520834505426*^9, 3.945520874648068*^9}, {
